    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Greeblings, chaos unfolds as players take on wildly different roles in a colorful world of traps, power-ups, and precision shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811700/extras/07ffbb0b57cccbb7e489d24e330c10b5.poster.avif?t=1751357620\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811700/extras/07ffbb0b57cccbb7e489d24e330c10b5.webm?t=1751357620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811700/extras/07ffbb0b57cccbb7e489d24e330c10b5.mp4?t=1751357620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greeblings collect random abilities from item boxes to boost, dash, or fly their way up the map, while the Hunter stays at a distance triggering traps and shooting paintballs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round is quick, chaotic, and full of surprises. Greeblings turns simple platforming into a vibrant, asymmetric showdown packed with laughs and unpredictable twists.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Greeblings, chaos unfolds as players take on wildly different roles in a colorful world of traps, power-ups, and precision shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811700/extras/07ffbb0b57cccbb7e489d24e330c10b5.poster.avif?t=1751357620\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811700/extras/07ffbb0b57cccbb7e489d24e330c10b5.webm?t=1751357620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811700/extras/07ffbb0b57cccbb7e489d24e330c10b5.mp4?t=1751357620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greeblings collect random abilities from item boxes to boost, dash, or fly their way up the map, while the Hunter stays at a distance triggering traps and shooting paintballs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round is quick, chaotic, and full of surprises. Greeblings turns simple platforming into a vibrant, asymmetric showdown packed with laughs and unpredictable twists.</p>",
